         python3-wb-common,
         wb-mqtt-confed
Description: Send Wiren Board meter readings to the Waterius cloud
 wb-mqtt-waterius reads meter values published to MQTT by Wiren Board and
 sends them on the scheduled days and time to the waterius.ru personal cabinet
 through the universal HTTP API. Configuration is done in the web UI
 (Settings -> Configuration files) via a json-editor schema.
